A refund in lanes

`Support` and `Finance` are teams. The `Agent` is owned by `Support`. The
`Refund tool` and the `Bank` are owned by `Finance`. Use the key `owner`. Write
the story `refund`: the `Agent` opens a refund in the `Refund tool`, and the
`Refund tool` sends money through the `Bank`. Show it as lanes.
---
Agent { owner: Support }
Refund tool, Bank { owner: Finance }
story refund {
  Agent -> Refund tool: open refund
  Refund tool -> Bank: send money
}
show lanes of refund
